# Platform Guidelines

Per-platform behavior for HOSSPI HMS on all enabled Flutter targets.

## Mandatory rules

- Must support Android, iOS, Web, Windows, macOS, and Linux where enabled.
- Platform checks must live only at infrastructure boundaries, not throughout feature UI.
- Web: must handle URLs, refresh, keyboard/pointer, and storage limits.
- Desktop: must support resizable windows, menu bar, side nav, shortcuts, and hover.
- Mobile: must handle touch, safe areas, keyboard insets, and back behavior.
- Smartwatch layouts are out of scope.

## Build hosts

- iOS/macOS builds require a macOS host with Apple tooling.
- Windows/Linux builds require matching host tooling.
- CI may split platform builds across OS images.

